# Not published: the maintainer's working notes.
# Dutch, written for AI sessions, out of date within a day, and `mensen.md` holds working notes
# about named people from the community.
# What the public needs from them is in ARCHITECTURE.md and CONTRIBUTING.md.
brief/
BRIEF.md
.git-notes/

# build leftovers
dll/*.obj
dll/*.exp
dll/*.lib
dll/*.pdb
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# the built DLL belongs to a release, not to the history
dll/channel.dll

# Not published: dumps from the game and from the executable.
# This is Paradox's data. Generate it yourself with the game's debug commands.
naslag/
reports/rtti_typen.txt

# Not published: the sweep's raw material - 51 MB of widget trees and window captures taken from
# one game state on one machine. It is measurement, not source, and it is Paradox's interface.
# Produce it yourself with tools/ck3/harvest.py; what was learned from it is in ARCHITECTURE.md.
# The pattern also covers a parked round kept for comparison, such as harvest-2026-08-24-*.
harvest*/

# Not published: other people's work without a licence.
# The key script is Agami's OCR mod script with a change of our own; her repo has no licence
# file, so it cannot be shipped. See CREDITS.md.
CK3 toetsen.ahk

# third-party binaries that do not belong here
tools/autohotkey/
tools/ocr_modellen/
tools/nvda/nvdaControllerClient.dll
tools/nvda/*.exe

# machine-specific copies of settings
pdx_settings.origineel.txt
launcher-settings.origineel.json
